<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>All Night</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Dare</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">What's Wrong With New York?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4IGT69nbtQdRXNVIZaulOf</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.990" end="00:03.690">I wake up at noon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.690" end="00:05.650">Put on both of my shoes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.650" end="00:07.750">Crawl right back into bed and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.750" end="00:10.030">Sleep until the evening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.030" end="00:11.530">Get on the bus</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.480" end="00:12.980">Downtown or bust</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.930" end="00:15.150">Skip on the fare, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.150" end="00:17.700">Do you ever get the feeling?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.700" end="00:19.650">That we both know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.650" end="00:21.280">We're alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.280" end="00:25.230">But you can't go home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.230" end="00:27.350">When they kick us out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.350" end="00:29.130">In half an hour</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.130" end="00:33.470">There's a place I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.470" end="00:35.120">L.A. to New York</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.120" end="00:36.620">New York to L.A.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.530" end="00:38.030">All the other states</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.000" end="00:39.720">We could stay up late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.720" end="00:41.420">Or all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.420" end="00:42.940">L.A. to New York</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.940" end="00:44.440">New York to L.A.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.420" end="00:45.920">I want more than fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.880" end="00:47.800">Hope you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.800" end="00:55.620">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.620" end="01:03.560">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.560" end="01:05.060">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.900" end="01:10.290">I can't really rest, 'cause my mind keeps racing and I'm wasted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.290" end="01:12.490">Lying on the bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.490" end="01:14.230">I wanna get up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.230" end="01:18.180">I wanna walk the streets with you next to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.180" end="01:20.140">We don't have to sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.140" end="01:21.640">Until</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.890" end="01:22.390">L.A. to New York</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.270" end="01:23.830">New York to L.A.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.830" end="01:25.330">All the other states</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.230" end="01:26.980">We could stay up late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.980" end="01:28.720">Or all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.720" end="01:30.220">L.A. to New York</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.160" end="01:31.660">New York to L.A.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.620" end="01:33.120">I want more than fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.090" end="01:34.960">Hope you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.960" end="01:36.590">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.590" end="01:38.090">My house to your house</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.060" end="01:39.560">Your couch to my couch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.490" end="01:41.030">Promise it is nice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.030" end="01:42.870">You can spend the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.870" end="01:44.460">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.460" end="01:45.960">If you're feeling scared</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.960" end="01:47.460">Know they're only tears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.430" end="01:48.930">You will be alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.810" end="01:50.730">We can feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.730" end="01:58.620">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.620" end="02:06.420">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.420" end="02:14.370">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.370" end="02:22.230">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.230" end="02:30.230">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.680" end="02:33.180">L.A. to New York</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.040" end="02:34.540">New York to L.A.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.520" end="02:36.070">All the other states</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.070" end="02:37.830">We could stay up late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.830" end="02:39.430">Or all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.430" end="02:40.970">L.A. to New York</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.970" end="02:42.530">New York to L.A.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.530" end="02:44.030">I want more than fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.030" end="02:45.870">Hope you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.870" end="02:47.410">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.410" end="02:48.960">My house to your house</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.960" end="02:50.460">Your couch to my couch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.360" end="02:51.860">Promise it is nice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.830" end="02:53.760">You can spend the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.760" end="02:55.270">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.270" end="02:56.770">If you're feeling scared</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.720" end="02:58.250">Know they're only tears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.250" end="02:59.750">You will be alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.650" end="03:01.540">We can feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.540" end="03:09.480">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.480" end="03:17.320">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.320" end="03:25.230">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.230" end="03:32.970">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.970" end="03:40.970">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:40.970" end="03:48.870">All night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:48.870" end="03:52.870">All night</p></div></body></tt>